# Task 4 – Change Owner and Group Together

## Create File

```bash id="1yr1ap"
touch project-config.yaml
```

## Change Owner and Group

```bash id="t5tzxp"
sudo chown professor:money-heist project-config.yaml
```

## Verify

```bash id="ih02qw"
ls -l project-config.yaml
```

### What the Command Does

```text id="g3zj8x"
chown professor:money-heist project-config.yaml
      │         │
      │         └── Group owner
      └──────────── User owner
```

---

## Create Directory

```bash id="3eafhj"
mkdir app-logs
```

## Change Owner and Group

```bash id="yi63f9"
sudo chown berlin:money-heist app-logs
```

## Verify

```bash id="e9bx7t"
ls -ld app-logs
```

### Observation

The owner and group were successfully changed using a single `chown` command.

### Key Learning

```bash
